{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","因度厄"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名武艺超群的射手，能够同时发射数枚箭矢攻击敌人。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","行动开始"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","It's time to act!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","再接再厉"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Keep up the good work."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","发现目标"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Target identified."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","到此为止了……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","This is where it ends..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","大获全胜"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","准备完毕，随时出击"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","All set... I await your command."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有些僵硬……怎么了？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","There's some tension... What's going on?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","手指和手腕都要保持灵活。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Keep your hands steady... Don't lose focus."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","示范？就这样，瞄准——射。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","A demonstration? Very well. Aim... Fire."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","非常感谢，我很喜欢。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","多谢，我收下了。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","王城夜卫"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","守护吧，即使沉沦于比夜晚更深沉的黑暗。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","渊火之誓"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","熔火将他的誓言，铸为牢不可破的坚甲。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","完成剧情任务“神明的声音”特定环节获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真是个热闹的地方"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","要慢慢适应各种变化……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","太丰盛了，对我来说……"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","因度厄是萨洛克兰历史上第一位加入王城卫队的平民。像这样的“第一”记录，在他的生涯中简直数不胜数，在将来还会继续增加。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","无论怎样恶劣的地形，因度厄都能自如地攀爬、跳跃、奔行——就像一道迅疾而致命的黑影。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","尽管因度厄看起来不好接近，但他其实有不少仰慕者，甚至在萨洛克兰贵族少女的理想情人排行榜中，他常年位居前三。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","因度厄不善言辞，也不善社交，所以他所有朋友都是主动找上门来的，而因度厄尽管从未付诸言语，但经常在心中默默感谢这份友情。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","都铎曾经极端反对平民加入卫队，但因度厄的出色表现激起了他同为武者的惺惺相惜，反而让他率先投出了赞成票。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","因度厄对食物的口味没有任何偏好，无论什么，他都能像是没有味觉一般面不改色地吃下去——但奇妙的是，他厨艺居然相当不错。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","因度厄有着出众的动态视觉，据说他能瞬间看清数十只飞蛾的飞舞轨迹，并准确射中有标记的那几只。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","因度厄滴酒不沾，不仅是因为自律，也是因为他一杯必醉，而酒品更是异常的差。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","因度厄不太擅长日常闲聊，刚认识斐利尔时，只要碰面，他就会异常主动地过来搭话，这甚至让因度厄一度更改了自己的巡视路线。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","“别看他那个样子，实际上特别爱操心，想让他追在你屁股后头收拾，就尽情地惹点无伤大雅的麻烦吧。”某位不愿透露姓名的面具男子如是说。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","那是在我当上卫队成员不久后，因为某些事情，在银月祭庭外徘徊。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411100.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","因度厄"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","萨洛克兰"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","这不是我的木头卫队长和他的得力助手嘛。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411110.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","沙利叶 & 因度厄"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","萨洛克兰"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","如果你在野外遇到孽化之人，虽然心理会难以承受……"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411160.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","因度厄"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","萨洛克兰"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","在地底守卫不可告人的秘密……将军，这就是你对萨洛克兰的守护方式？"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411180.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","因度厄 & 都铎"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","余烬矿脉"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","能从平民中被选拔为卫兵，再被选为卫队长是很幸运的事。"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411190.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","因度厄"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","余烬矿脉"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","如果我能更早察觉艾塞勒生活在谎言之中，揭开这所有欺骗的真相……"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411220.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","因度厄"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","余烬矿脉"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","偶尔到地面上散散步，透透气，真不错嘛。"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411230.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","祖娅 & 因度厄"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","锻炉峡湾"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","朝阳东升，晚霞夕照，月亮与繁星散发光辉……"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411250.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","因度厄"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","沙利叶让我前往地表的目的，或许是为了验证我说出口的“真相”。"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep4/herohub_story/14411270.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","因度厄"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","奈萨雷斯的残暴统治结束了，接下来的管理应当更温和一些。"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415659.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","因度厄 & 斯莱泽"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","新生的树该怎么照顾呢。"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415671.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","因度厄 & 埃隆"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","真是个热闹的地方"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415675.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","因度厄"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","太丰盛了，对我来说……"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415676.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","因度厄"]]}